  "title": "Israeli Moroccan Couscous",
  "description": "Carrots, turnips, sweet potatoes, zucchini and red bell pepper are simmered with garbanzo beans and tomato sauce, and flavored with cinnamon, turmeric and curry. This beautiful, tasty concoction is served atop hot couscous.",
  "authors": [
    "Cigall Daboosh Goldman"
